      "ayahEnd": 170,
      "type": "single",
      "ayahCount": 1,
      "input": {
        "sira": 75,
        "ref": "002/170",
        "input_type": "tekil",
        "input_ayah_count": 1,
        "input_char_count": 228,
        "input_status": "ok",
        "input_source_ref_groups": "002/170"
      },
      "source": {
        "arabic": "Tanzil Quran Text / Uthmani text",
        "tr": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
        "trAlt": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
        "en": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
        "enAlt": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi"
      },
      "sourceRefGroups": [
        "002/170"
      ],
      "ayahs": [
        {
          "ref": "002/170",
          "surah": 2,
          "ayah": 170,
          "arabic": "وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمُ ٱتَّبِعُوا۟ مَآ أَنزَلَ ٱللَّهُ قَالُوا۟ بَلْ نَتَّبِعُ مَآ أَلْفَيْنَا عَلَيْهِ ءَابَآءَنَآ ۗ أَوَلَوْ كَانَ ءَابَآؤُهُمْ لَا يَعْقِلُونَ شَيْـًٔا وَلَا يَهْتَدُونَ",
          "tr": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
            "sourceRef": "002/170",
            "text": "Ne zaman onlara: \"Allah'ın indirdiklerine uyun\" denilse, onlar: \"Hayır, biz, atalarımızı üzerinde bulduğumuz şeye (geleneğe) uyarız\" derler. (Peki) Ya atalarının aklı bir şeye ermez ve doğru yolu da bulamamış idiyseler?"
          },
          "trAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "002/170",
            "text": "Onlara: \"Allah'ın indirdiğine uyun\" denilince, \"Hayır, atalarımızı yapar bulduğumuz şeye uyarız\" derler; ya ataları bir şey akledemeyen ve doğru olmayan kimseler idiyseler?"
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "002/170",
            "text": "And when it is said to them, \"Follow what Allah has revealed,\" they say, \"Rather, we will follow that which we found our fathers doing.\" Even though their fathers understood nothing, nor were they guided?"
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "002/170",
            "text": "When it is said to them, \"Follow the Commands that Allah has sent down,\" they reply, \"We will follow only what we found our forefathers practising., Well, will they go on following their forefathers even though they did not use common sense and did not find the right way?"
          }
        }
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "priority_key": "normal",
        "priority": 1,
        "boost": {
          "enabled": false,
          "weight": 1
        },
        "note": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
        "updated_at": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00"
      },
      "surah_name": "Bakara",
      "ayah_number": 170,
      "ayah_end_number": 170,
      "text_ar": "وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمُ ٱتَّبِعُوا۟ مَآ أَنزَلَ ٱللَّهُ قَالُوا۟ بَلْ نَتَّبِعُ مَآ أَلْفَيْنَا عَلَيْهِ ءَابَآءَنَآ ۗ أَوَلَوْ كَانَ ءَابَآؤُهُمْ لَا يَعْقِلُونَ شَيْـًٔا وَلَا يَهْتَدُونَ",
