      "text_ar": "وَقَالَت طَّآئِفَةٌ مِّنْ أَهْلِ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ ءَامِنُوا۟ بِٱلَّذِىٓ أُنزِلَ عَلَى ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَجْهَ ٱلنَّهَارِ وَٱكْفُرُوٓا۟ ءَاخِرَهُۥ لَعَلَّهُمْ يَرْجِعُونَ",
      "text_tr": "Kitap Ehlinden bir bölümü, dedi ki: \"İman edenlere inene gündüzün başlangıcında inanın, bitiminde ise inkar edin. Belki onlar da dönerler.\"",
      "text_en": "And a faction of the People of the Scripture say [to each other], \"Believe in that which was revealed to the believers at the beginning of the day and reject it at its end that perhaps they will abandon their religion,",
      "priority": 1,
      "notes": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
      "approvedAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
