      "surah_name": "Ali Imran",
      "ayah_number": 95,
      "ayah_end_number": 95,
      "text_ar": "قُلْ صَدَقَ ٱللَّهُ ۗ فَٱتَّبِعُوا۟ مِلَّةَ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ حَنِيفًا وَمَا كَانَ مِنَ ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ",
      "text_tr": "De ki: \"Allah doğru söyledi. Öyleyse Allah'ı bir tanıyan (Hanif)ler olarak İbrahim'in dinine uyun. O, müşriklerden değildi.\"",
      "text_en": "Say, \"Allah has told the truth. So follow the religion of Abraham, inclining toward truth; and he was not of the polytheists.\"",
      "priority": 1,
      "notes": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
