      "text_en": "And that He might make evident those who are hypocrites. For it was said to them, \"Come, fight in the way of Allah or [at least] defend.\" They said, \"If we had known [there would be] fighting, we would have followed you.\" They were nearer to disbelief that day than to faith, saying with their mouths what was not in their hearts. And Allah is most Knowing of what they conceal -",
