      "surah_name": "Enfal",
      "ayah_number": 24,
      "ayah_end_number": 24,
      "text_ar": "يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ٱسْتَجِيبُوا۟ لِلَّهِ وَلِلرَّسُولِ إِذَا دَعَاكُمْ لِمَا يُحْيِيكُمْ ۖ وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَحُولُ بَيْنَ ٱلْمَرْءِ وَقَلْبِهِۦ وَأَنَّهُۥٓ إِلَيْهِ تُحْشَرُونَ",
      "text_tr": "Ey iman edenler, size hayat verecek şeylere sizi çağırdığı zaman, Allah'a ve Resûlü’ne icabet edin. Ve bilin ki muhakkak Allah, kişi ile kalbi arasına girer ve siz gerçekten O'na götürülüp toplanacaksınız.",
      "text_en": "O you who have believed, respond to Allah and to the Messenger when he calls you to that which gives you life. And know that Allah intervenes between a man and his heart and that to Him you will be gathered.",
      "priority": 1,
      "notes": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-09T08:50:08+00:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-09T08:50:08+00:00",
      "approvedAt": "2026-06-09T08:50:08+00:00",
