        "updated_at": "2026-06-09T08:50:08+00:00"
      },
      "surah_name": "Tevbe",
      "ayah_number": 123,
      "ayah_end_number": 123,
      "text_ar": "يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ قَـٰتِلُوا۟ ٱلَّذِينَ يَلُونَكُم مِّنَ ٱلْكُفَّارِ وَلْيَجِدُوا۟ فِيكُمْ غِلْظَةً ۚ وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ مَعَ ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ",
      "text_tr": "Ey iman edenler, inkar edenlerden size en yakın olanlarla savaşın; sizde 'bir güç ve caydırıcılık' görsünler. Ve bilin ki gerçekten Allah takva sahipleriyle beraberdir.",
      "text_en": "O you who have believed, fight those adjacent to you of the disbelievers and let them find in you harshness. And know that Allah is with the righteous.",
      "priority": 1,
      "notes": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-09T08:50:08+00:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-09T08:50:08+00:00",
      "approvedAt": "2026-06-09T08:50:08+00:00",
