      "text_ar": "وَلَا تَقْفُ مَا لَيْسَ لَكَ بِهِۦ عِلْمٌ ۚ إِنَّ ٱلسَّمْعَ وَٱلْبَصَرَ وَٱلْفُؤَادَ كُلُّ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ كَانَ عَنْهُ مَسْـُٔولًا",
      "text_tr": "Hakkında bilgin olmayan şeyin ardına düşme; çünkü kulak, göz ve kalp, bunların hepsi ondan sorumludur.",
      "text_en": "And do not pursue that of which you have no knowledge. Indeed, the hearing, the sight and the heart - about all those [one] will be questioned.",
      "priority": 1,
      "notes": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-09T08:50:08+00:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-09T08:50:08+00:00",
      "approvedAt": "2026-06-09T08:50:08+00:00",
