      "surah_name": "Lokman",
      "ayah_number": 17,
      "ayah_end_number": 17,
      "text_ar": "يَـٰبُنَىَّ أَقِمِ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ وَأْمُرْ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ وَٱنْهَ عَنِ ٱلْمُنكَرِ وَٱصْبِرْ عَلَىٰ مَآ أَصَابَكَ ۖ إِنَّ ذَٰلِكَ مِنْ عَزْمِ ٱلْأُمُورِ",
      "text_tr": "\"Ey oğlum, namazı dosdoğru kıl, ma'rufu emret, münkerden sakındır ve sana isabet eden (musibetler)e karşı sabret. Çünkü bunlar, azmedilmesi gereken işlerdendir.",
      "text_en": "O my son, establish prayer, enjoin what is right, forbid what is wrong, and be patient over what befalls you. Indeed, [all] that is of the matters [requiring] determination.",
      "priority": 1,
      "notes": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-09T08:50:08+00:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-09T08:50:08+00:00",
      "approvedAt": "2026-06-09T08:50:08+00:00",
