      "surah_name": "Yunus",
      "ayah_number": 84,
      "ayah_end_number": 84,
      "text_ar": "وَقَالَ مُوسَىٰ يَـٰقَوْمِ إِن كُنتُمْ ءَامَنتُم بِٱللَّهِ فَعَلَيْهِ تَوَكَّلُوٓا۟ إِن كُنتُم مُّسْلِمِينَ",
      "text_tr": "Musa dedi ki: \"Ey kavmim, eğer siz Allah'a iman edip Müslüman olmuşsanız artık yalnızca O'na tevekkül edin.\"",
      "text_en": "And Moses said, \"O my people, if you have believed in Allah, then rely upon Him, if you should be Muslims.\"",
