      "ayah_number": 103,
      "ayah_end_number": 103,
      "text_ar": "ثُمَّ نُنَجِّى رُسُلَنَا وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ حَقًّا عَلَيْنَا نُنجِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ",
      "text_tr": "Sonra Biz, elçilerimizi ve iman edenleri böyle kurtarırız; mü'minleri kurtarmamız Bizim üzerimize bir haktır.",
      "text_en": "Then We will save our messengers and those who have believed. Thus, it is an obligation upon Us that We save the believers",
      "priority": 1,
      "notes": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
      "approvedAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
