      "input": {
        "sira": 679,
        "ref": "016/057-059",
        "input_type": "aralik",
        "input_ayah_count": 3,
        "input_char_count": 355,
        "input_status": "ok",
        "input_source_ref_groups": "016/057, 016/058, 016/059"
      },
      "source": {
        "arabic": "Tanzil Quran Text / Uthmani text",
        "tr": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
        "trAlt": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
        "en": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
        "enAlt": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi"
      },
      "sourceRefGroups": [
        "016/057",
        "016/058",
        "016/059"
      ],
      "ayahs": [
        {
          "ref": "016/057",
          "surah": 16,
          "ayah": 57,
          "arabic": "وَيَجْعَلُونَ لِلَّهِ ٱلْبَنَـٰتِ سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥ ۙ وَلَهُم مَّا يَشْتَهُونَ",
          "tr": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
            "sourceRef": "016/057",
            "text": "Ve Allah'a kızlar isnad ediyorlar, (haşa) O Yücedir. Hoşlandıkları (erkek çocuklar) da kendilerinindir."
          },
          "trAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "016/057",
            "text": "Beğendikleri erkek çocukları kendilerine; kızları da Allah'a malediyorlar. O bundan münezzehtir."
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "016/057",
            "text": "And they attribute to Allah daughters - exalted is He - and for them is what they desire."
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "016/057",
            "text": "They assign daughters to Allah - glory be to Him - whereas they assign to themselves what they truly desire!"
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "016/058",
          "surah": 16,
          "ayah": 58,
          "arabic": "وَإِذَا بُشِّرَ أَحَدُهُم بِٱلْأُنثَىٰ ظَلَّ وَجْهُهُۥ مُسْوَدًّا وَهُوَ كَظِيمٌ",
          "tr": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
            "sourceRef": "016/058",
            "text": "Onlardan birine kız (çocuk) müjdelendiği zaman içi öfkeyle-taşarak yüzü simsiyah kesilir."
          },
          "trAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "016/058",
            "text": "Aralarından birine bir kızı olduğu müjdelendiği zaman içi gamla dolarak yüzü simsiyah kesilir."
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "016/058",
            "text": "And when one of them is informed of [the birth of] a female, his face becomes dark, and he suppresses grief."
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "016/058",
            "text": "When any of them is told about the birth of a female his face turns dark, and he is filled with suppressed anger,"
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "016/059",
          "surah": 16,
          "ayah": 59,
          "arabic": "يَتَوَٰرَىٰ مِنَ ٱلْقَوْمِ مِن سُوٓءِ مَا بُشِّرَ بِهِۦٓ ۚ أَيُمْسِكُهُۥ عَلَىٰ هُونٍ أَمْ يَدُسُّهُۥ فِى ٱلتُّرَابِ ۗ أَلَا سَآءَ مَا يَحْكُمُونَ",
          "tr": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
            "sourceRef": "016/059",
            "text": "Kendisine verilen müjdenin kötülüğünden dolayı topluluktan gizlenir; onu aşağılanarak tutacak mı, yoksa toprağa gömecek mi? Bak, verdikleri hüküm ne kötüdür?"
          },
          "trAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "016/059",
            "text": "Kendisine verilen kötü müjde yüzünden, halktan gizlenmeye çalışır; onu utana utana tutsun mu, yoksa toprağa mı gömsün? Ne kötü hükmediyorlar!"
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "016/059",
            "text": "He hides himself from the people because of the ill of which he has been informed. Should he keep it in humiliation or bury it in the ground? Unquestionably, evil is what they decide."
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "016/059",
            "text": "and he hides himself from people because of the bad news, thinking: should he keep the child despite disgrace, or should he bury it in dust? How evil is their estimate of Allah!"
          }
        }
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "priority_key": "normal",
        "priority": 1,
        "boost": {
          "enabled": false,
          "weight": 1
        },
        "note": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
        "updated_at": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00"
      },
      "surah_name": "Nahl",
      "ayah_number": 57,
      "ayah_end_number": 59,
      "text_ar": "﴿57﴾ وَيَجْعَلُونَ لِلَّهِ ٱلْبَنَـٰتِ سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥ ۙ وَلَهُم مَّا يَشْتَهُونَ\n\n﴿58﴾ وَإِذَا بُشِّرَ أَحَدُهُم بِٱلْأُنثَىٰ ظَلَّ وَجْهُهُۥ مُسْوَدًّا وَهُوَ كَظِيمٌ\n\n﴿59﴾ يَتَوَٰرَىٰ مِنَ ٱلْقَوْمِ مِن سُوٓءِ مَا بُشِّرَ بِهِۦٓ ۚ أَيُمْسِكُهُۥ عَلَىٰ هُونٍ أَمْ يَدُسُّهُۥ فِى ٱلتُّرَابِ ۗ أَلَا سَآءَ مَا يَحْكُمُونَ",
      "text_tr": "[57] Ve Allah'a kızlar isnad ediyorlar, (haşa) O Yücedir. Hoşlandıkları (erkek çocuklar) da kendilerinindir.\n\n[58] Onlardan birine kız (çocuk) müjdelendiği zaman içi öfkeyle-taşarak yüzü simsiyah kesilir.\n\n[59] Kendisine verilen müjdenin kötülüğünden dolayı topluluktan gizlenir; onu aşağılanarak tutacak mı, yoksa toprağa gömecek mi? Bak, verdikleri hüküm ne kötüdür?",
      "text_en": "[57] And they attribute to Allah daughters - exalted is He - and for them is what they desire.\n\n[58] And when one of them is informed of [the birth of] a female, his face becomes dark, and he suppresses grief.\n\n[59] He hides himself from the people because of the ill of which he has been informed. Should he keep it in humiliation or bury it in the ground? Unquestionably, evil is what they decide.",
      "priority": 1,
      "notes": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
