      "text_en": "[110] Then, indeed your Lord, to those who emigrated after they had been compelled [to renounce their religion] and thereafter fought [for the cause of Allah] and were patient - indeed, your Lord, after that, is Forgiving and Merciful\n\n[111] On the Day when every soul will come disputing for itself, and every soul will be fully compensated for what it did, and they will not be wronged.",
