            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "016/119",
            "text": "Sonra doğrusu Rabbin, bilmeyerek kötülük işleyip ardından tevbe eden ve ıslah olanlardan yanadır. Rabbin bundan sonra da bağışlar ve merhamet eder."
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "016/119",
            "text": "Then, indeed your Lord, to those who have done wrong out of ignorance and then repent after that and correct themselves - indeed, your Lord, thereafter, is Forgiving and Merciful."
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "016/119",
            "text": "But to those who commit evil out of ignorance and then repent and amend their ways, thereafter your Lord will be Much Forgiving, Most Merciful."
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "016/120",
          "surah": 16,
          "ayah": 120,
          "arabic": "إِنَّ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ كَانَ أُمَّةً قَانِتًا لِّلَّهِ حَنِيفًا وَلَمْ يَكُ مِنَ ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ",
          "tr": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
            "sourceRef": "016/120",
            "text": "Gerçek şu ki, İbrahim (tek başına) bir ümmetti; Allah'a gönülden yönelip itaat eden bir muvahhiddi ve o müşriklerden değildi."
          },
          "trAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "016/120",
            "text": "İbrahim, şüphesiz Allah'a boyun eğen ve O'na yönelen bir önderdi; puta tapanlardan değildi."
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "016/120",
            "text": "Indeed, Abraham was a [comprehensive] leader, devoutly obedient to Allah, inclining toward truth, and he was not of those who associate others with Allah."
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "016/120",
            "text": "Indeed Abraham was a whole community by himself, obedient to Allah, exclusively devoted to Him. And he was never one of those who associated others with Allah in His Divinity."
          }
        }
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "priority_key": "normal",
        "priority": 1,
        "boost": {
          "enabled": false,
          "weight": 1
        },
        "note": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
        "updated_at": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00"
      },
      "surah_name": "Nahl",
      "ayah_number": 119,
      "ayah_end_number": 120,
      "text_ar": "﴿119﴾ ثُمَّ إِنَّ رَبَّكَ لِلَّذِينَ عَمِلُوا۟ ٱلسُّوٓءَ بِجَهَـٰلَةٍ ثُمَّ تَابُوا۟ مِنۢ بَعْدِ ذَٰلِكَ وَأَصْلَحُوٓا۟ إِنَّ رَبَّكَ مِنۢ بَعْدِهَا لَغَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ\n\n﴿120﴾ إِنَّ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ كَانَ أُمَّةً قَانِتًا لِّلَّهِ حَنِيفًا وَلَمْ يَكُ مِنَ ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ",
      "text_tr": "[119] Sonra gerçekten Rabbin, cehalet sonucu kötülük işleyen, sonra bunun ardından tevbe eden ve ıslah olanlar(la beraberdir). Şüphesiz Rabbin bundan sonra bağışlayandır, esirgeyendir.\n\n[120] Gerçek şu ki, İbrahim (tek başına) bir ümmetti; Allah'a gönülden yönelip itaat eden bir muvahhiddi ve o müşriklerden değildi.",
      "text_en": "[119] Then, indeed your Lord, to those who have done wrong out of ignorance and then repent after that and correct themselves - indeed, your Lord, thereafter, is Forgiving and Merciful.\n\n[120] Indeed, Abraham was a [comprehensive] leader, devoutly obedient to Allah, inclining toward truth, and he was not of those who associate others with Allah.",
      "priority": 1,
      "notes": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
