      "ayah_number": 26,
      "ayah_end_number": 27,
      "text_ar": "﴿26﴾ وَءَاتِ ذَا ٱلْقُرْبَىٰ حَقَّهُۥ وَٱلْمِسْكِينَ وَٱبْنَ ٱلسَّبِيلِ وَلَا تُبَذِّرْ تَبْذِيرًا\n\n﴿27﴾ إِنَّ ٱلْمُبَذِّرِينَ كَانُوٓا۟ إِخْوَٰنَ ٱلشَّيَـٰطِينِ ۖ وَكَانَ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ لِرَبِّهِۦ كَفُورًا",
      "text_tr": "[26] Akrabaya hakkını ver, yoksula ve yolda kalmışa da. İsraf ederek saçıp-savurma.\n\n[27] Çünkü saçıp-savuranlar, şeytanın kardeşleri olmuşlardır; şeytan ise Rabbine karşı nankördür.",
      "text_en": "[26] And give the relative his right, and [also] the poor and the traveler, and do not spend wastefully.\n\n[27] Indeed, the wasteful are brothers of the devils, and ever has Satan been to his Lord ungrateful.",
      "priority": 1,
      "notes": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
      "approvedAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
