      },
      "source": {
        "arabic": "Tanzil Quran Text / Uthmani text",
        "tr": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
        "trAlt": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
        "en": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
        "enAlt": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi"
      },
      "sourceRefGroups": [
        "017/101"
      ],
      "ayahs": [
        {
          "ref": "017/101",
          "surah": 17,
          "ayah": 101,
          "arabic": "وَلَقَدْ ءَاتَيْنَا مُوسَىٰ تِسْعَ ءَايَـٰتٍۭ بَيِّنَـٰتٍ ۖ فَسْـَٔلْ بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ إِذْ جَآءَهُمْ فَقَالَ لَهُۥ فِرْعَوْنُ إِنِّى لَأَظُنُّكَ يَـٰمُوسَىٰ مَسْحُورًا",
          "tr": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
            "sourceRef": "017/101",
            "text": "Andolsun, Biz Musa'ya apaçık dokuz ayet (mucize) vermiştik; işte İsrailoğulları'na sor; onlara geldiği zaman Firavun ona: \"Gerçekten ben seni büyülenmiş sanıyorum\" demişti."
          },
          "trAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "017/101",
            "text": "And olsun ki, Musa'ya dokuz tane apaçık mucize verdik. İsrailoğullarına sor, Musa onlara geldiğinde, Firavun kendisine: \"Ey Musa! Ben seni büyülenmiş sanıyorum\" demişti."
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "017/101",
            "text": "And We had certainly given Moses nine evident signs, so ask the Children of Israel [about] when he came to them and Pharaoh said to him, \"Indeed I think, O Moses, that you are affected by magic.\""
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "017/101",
            "text": "We granted Moses nine clear signs. Ask the Children of Israel about that: when these signs came forth, Pharaoh said to him: \"Moses, I think that you are bewitched.\""
          }
        }
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "priority_key": "normal",
        "priority": 1,
        "boost": {
          "enabled": false,
          "weight": 1
        },
        "note": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
        "updated_at": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00"
      },
