            "sourceRef": "019/089",
            "text": "You have done an atrocious thing."
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "019/089",
            "text": "Surely you have made a monstrous statement."
          }
