      "surah_name": "Enbiya",
      "ayah_number": 57,
      "ayah_end_number": 57,
      "text_ar": "وَتَٱللَّهِ لَأَكِيدَنَّ أَصْنَـٰمَكُم بَعْدَ أَن تُوَلُّوا۟ مُدْبِرِينَ",
      "text_tr": "\"Andolsun Allah'a, sizler arkanızı dönüp gittikten sonra, ben sizin putlarınıza muhakkak bir tuzak kuracağım.\"",
      "text_en": "And [I swear] by Allah, I will surely plan against your idols after you have turned and gone away.\"",
      "priority": 1,
      "notes": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
