        "input_type": "aralik",
        "input_ayah_count": 2,
        "input_char_count": 128,
        "input_status": "ok",
        "input_source_ref_groups": "021/052, 021/053"
      },
      "source": {
        "arabic": "Tanzil Quran Text / Uthmani text",
        "tr": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
        "trAlt": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
        "en": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
        "enAlt": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi"
      },
      "sourceRefGroups": [
        "021/052",
        "021/053"
      ],
      "ayahs": [
        {
          "ref": "021/052",
          "surah": 21,
          "ayah": 52,
          "arabic": "إِذْ قَالَ لِأَبِيهِ وَقَوْمِهِۦ مَا هَـٰذِهِ ٱلتَّمَاثِيلُ ٱلَّتِىٓ أَنتُمْ لَهَا عَـٰكِفُونَ",
          "tr": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
            "sourceRef": "021/052",
            "text": "Hani babasına ve kavmine demişti ki: \"Sizin, karşılarında bel büküp eğilmekte olduğunuz bu temsili heykeller nedir?"
          },
          "trAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "021/052",
            "text": "İbrahim, babasına ve milletine: \"Bu tapınıp durduğunuz heykeller nedir?\" demişti."
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "021/052",
            "text": "When he said to his father and his people, \"What are these statues to which you are devoted?\""
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "021/052",
            "text": "Recall, when he said to his father and his people: \"What are these images to which you are devoutly clinging?\""
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "021/053",
          "surah": 21,
          "ayah": 53,
          "arabic": "قَالُوا۟ وَجَدْنَآ ءَابَآءَنَا لَهَا عَـٰبِدِينَ",
          "tr": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
            "sourceRef": "021/053",
            "text": "\"Biz atalarımızı bunlara tapıyor bulduk\" dediler."
          },
          "trAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "021/053",
            "text": "\"Babalarımızı onlara tapar bulduk\" demişlerdi."
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "021/053",
            "text": "They said, \"We found our fathers worshippers of them.\""
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "021/053",
            "text": "They answered: \"We found our fathers worshipping them.\""
          }
        }
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "priority_key": "normal",
        "priority": 1,
        "boost": {
          "enabled": false,
          "weight": 1
        },
        "note": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
        "updated_at": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00"
      },
      "surah_name": "Enbiya",
      "ayah_number": 52,
      "ayah_end_number": 53,
      "text_ar": "﴿52﴾ إِذْ قَالَ لِأَبِيهِ وَقَوْمِهِۦ مَا هَـٰذِهِ ٱلتَّمَاثِيلُ ٱلَّتِىٓ أَنتُمْ لَهَا عَـٰكِفُونَ\n\n﴿53﴾ قَالُوا۟ وَجَدْنَآ ءَابَآءَنَا لَهَا عَـٰبِدِينَ",
      "text_tr": "[52] Hani babasına ve kavmine demişti ki: \"Sizin, karşılarında bel büküp eğilmekte olduğunuz bu temsili heykeller nedir?\n\n[53] \"Biz atalarımızı bunlara tapıyor bulduk\" dediler.",
      "text_en": "[52] When he said to his father and his people, \"What are these statues to which you are devoted?\"\n\n[53] They said, \"We found our fathers worshippers of them.\"",
