      "surah_name": "Nur",
      "ayah_number": 32,
      "ayah_end_number": 32,
      "text_ar": "وَأَنكِحُوا۟ ٱلْأَيَـٰمَىٰ مِنكُمْ وَٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ مِنْ عِبَادِكُمْ وَإِمَآئِكُمْ ۚ إِن يَكُونُوا۟ فُقَرَآءَ يُغْنِهِمُ ٱللَّهُ مِن فَضْلِهِۦ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ وَٰسِعٌ عَلِيمٌ",
      "text_tr": "İçinizde evli olmayanları, kölelerinizden ve cariyelerinizden salih olanları evlendirin. Eğer fakir iseler Allah, Kendi fazlından onları zengin eder. Allah geniş (nimet sahibi)dir, bilendir.",
      "text_en": "And marry the unmarried among you and the righteous among your male slaves and female slaves. If they should be poor, Allah will enrich them from His bounty, and Allah is all-Encompassing and Knowing.",
      "priority": 1,
      "notes": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
      "approvedAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
