    {
      "ref": "024/039",
      "id": "024/039",
      "surah": 24,
      "ayahStart": 39,
      "ayahEnd": 39,
      "type": "single",
      "ayahCount": 1,
      "input": {
        "sira": 838,
        "ref": "024/039",
        "input_type": "tekil",
        "input_ayah_count": 1,
        "input_char_count": 305,
        "input_status": "ok",
        "input_source_ref_groups": "024/039"
      },
      "source": {
        "arabic": "Tanzil Quran Text / Uthmani text",
        "tr": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
        "trAlt": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
        "en": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
        "enAlt": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi"
      },
      "sourceRefGroups": [
        "024/039"
      ],
      "ayahs": [
        {
          "ref": "024/039",
          "surah": 24,
          "ayah": 39,
          "arabic": "وَٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوٓا۟ أَعْمَـٰلُهُمْ كَسَرَابٍۭ بِقِيعَةٍ يَحْسَبُهُ ٱلظَّمْـَٔانُ مَآءً حَتَّىٰٓ إِذَا جَآءَهُۥ لَمْ يَجِدْهُ شَيْـًٔا وَوَجَدَ ٱللَّهَ عِندَهُۥ فَوَفَّىٰهُ حِسَابَهُۥ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ سَرِيعُ ٱلْحِسَابِ",
          "tr": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
            "sourceRef": "024/039",
            "text": "İnkar edenler ise; onların amelleri dümdüz bir arazideki seraba benzer; susayan onu bir su sanır. Nihayet ona ulaştığında bir şey bulamaz ve yanında Allah'ı bulur. (Allah da) Onun hesabını tam olarak verir. Allah, hesabı çok seri görendir."
          },
          "trAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "024/039",
            "text": "İnkar edenlerin işleri engin çöllerdeki serap gibidir. Susayan kimse onu su zanneder, fakat oraya geldiğinde hiçbir şey bulamaz. Orada Allah'ı bulur ve O da hesabını görür. Allah hesabı çabuk görendir."
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "024/039",
            "text": "But those who disbelieved - their deeds are like a mirage in a lowland which a thirsty one thinks is water until, when he comes to it, he finds it is nothing but finds Allah before Him, and He will pay him in full his due; and Allah is swift in account."
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "024/039",
            "text": "(On the other hand,) the deeds of those who disbelieved, maybe likened to a mirage in a waterless desert, which the thirsty one took for water; but when he reached there he found nothing to drink; nay, he found there Allah Who settled his full account, and Allah is very swift at reckoning."
          }
        }
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "priority_key": "normal",
        "priority": 1,
        "boost": {
          "enabled": false,
          "weight": 1
        },
        "note": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
        "updated_at": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00"
      },
      "surah_name": "Nur",
      "ayah_number": 39,
