    {
      "ref": "025/021",
      "id": "025/021",
      "surah": 25,
      "ayahStart": 21,
      "ayahEnd": 21,
      "type": "single",
      "ayahCount": 1,
      "input": {
        "sira": 846,
        "ref": "025/021",
        "input_type": "tekil",
        "input_ayah_count": 1,
        "input_char_count": 193,
        "input_status": "ok",
        "input_source_ref_groups": "025/021"
      },
      "source": {
        "arabic": "Tanzil Quran Text / Uthmani text",
        "tr": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
        "trAlt": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
        "en": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
        "enAlt": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi"
      },
      "sourceRefGroups": [
        "025/021"
      ],
      "ayahs": [
        {
          "ref": "025/021",
          "surah": 25,
          "ayah": 21,
          "arabic": "وَقَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يَرْجُونَ لِقَآءَنَا لَوْلَآ أُنزِلَ عَلَيْنَا ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ أَوْ نَرَىٰ رَبَّنَا ۗ لَقَدِ ٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟ فِىٓ أَنفُسِهِمْ وَعَتَوْ عُتُوًّا كَبِيرًا",
          "tr": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
            "sourceRef": "025/021",
            "text": "Bize kavuşmayı ummayanlar, dediler ki: \"Bize meleklerin indirilmesi ya da Rabbimiz'i görmemiz gerekmez miydi?\" Andolsun, onlar kendi nefislerinde büyüklüğe kapıldılar ve büyük bir azgınlıkla baş kaldırdılar."
          },
          "trAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "025/021",
            "text": "Bizimle karşılaşmayı ummayanlar: \"Bize ya melekler indirilmeli, ya da Rabbimiz'i görmeliyiz\" derler. And olsun ki kendi kendilerine büyüklenmişler, azgınlıkta pek ileri gitmişlerdir."
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "025/021",
            "text": "And those who do not expect the meeting with Us say, \"Why were not angels sent down to us, or [why] do we [not] see our Lord?\" They have certainly become arrogant within themselves and [become] insolent with great insolence."
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "025/021",
            "text": "Those people, who have no fear of coming before Us, say, \"Why should not the angels be sent down to us? Or else we should see our Lord. \" Great arrogance have they assumed in regard to themselves, and have transgressed all limits in their rebellion."
          }
        }
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "priority_key": "normal",
        "priority": 1,
        "boost": {
          "enabled": false,
          "weight": 1
        },
        "note": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
        "updated_at": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00"
      },
