            "text": "He who created the heavens and the earth and what is between them in six days and then established Himself above the Throne - the Most Merciful, so ask about Him one well informed."
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "025/059",
            "text": "In six days He created the earth and the heavens and all that is between them; then He established Himself on the \"Throne\" (of the Kingdom of the uriverse). (He is) the Merciful: as to His Glory, ask the one who knows."
          }
        }
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "priority_key": "normal",
        "priority": 1,
        "boost": {
          "enabled": false,
          "weight": 1
        },
        "note": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
        "updated_at": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00"
      },
      "surah_name": "Furkan",
      "ayah_number": 58,
      "ayah_end_number": 59,
      "text_ar": "﴿58﴾ وَتَوَكَّلْ عَلَى ٱلْحَىِّ ٱلَّذِى لَا يَمُوتُ وَسَبِّحْ بِحَمْدِهِۦ ۚ وَكَفَىٰ بِهِۦ بِذُنُوبِ عِبَادِهِۦ خَبِيرًا\n\n﴿59﴾ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَا فِى سِتَّةِ أَيَّامٍ ثُمَّ ٱسْتَوَىٰ عَلَى ٱلْعَرْشِ ۚ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ فَسْـَٔلْ بِهِۦ خَبِيرًا",
      "text_tr": "[58] Sen, asla ölmeyen ve daima diri olan (Allah)a tevekkül et ve O'nu hamd ile tesbih et. Kullarının günahlarından O'nun haberdar olması yeter.\n\n[59] O, gökleri ve yeri ve ikisinin arasındakileri altı günde yaratan ve sonra arşa istiva edendir. Rahman (olan Allah)dır. Bunu (bundan) haberi olana sor.",
      "text_en": "[58] And rely upon the Ever-Living who does not die, and exalt [Allah] with His praise. And sufficient is He to be, with the sins of His servants, Acquainted -\n\n[59] He who created the heavens and the earth and what is between them in six days and then established Himself above the Throne - the Most Merciful, so ask about Him one well informed.",
      "priority": 1,
      "notes": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
