        "input_type": "aralik",
        "input_ayah_count": 2,
        "input_char_count": 292,
        "input_status": "ok",
        "input_source_ref_groups": "031/017, 031/018"
      },
      "source": {
        "arabic": "Tanzil Quran Text / Uthmani text",
        "tr": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
        "trAlt": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
        "en": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
        "enAlt": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi"
      },
      "sourceRefGroups": [
        "031/017",
        "031/018"
      ],
      "ayahs": [
        {
          "ref": "031/017",
          "surah": 31,
          "ayah": 17,
          "arabic": "يَـٰبُنَىَّ أَقِمِ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ وَأْمُرْ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ وَٱنْهَ عَنِ ٱلْمُنكَرِ وَٱصْبِرْ عَلَىٰ مَآ أَصَابَكَ ۖ إِنَّ ذَٰلِكَ مِنْ عَزْمِ ٱلْأُمُورِ",
          "tr": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
            "sourceRef": "031/017",
            "text": "\"Ey oğlum, namazı dosdoğru kıl, ma'rufu emret, münkerden sakındır ve sana isabet eden (musibetler)e karşı sabret. Çünkü bunlar, azmedilmesi gereken işlerdendir."
          },
          "trAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "031/017",
            "text": "\"Ey oğulcuğum! Namazı kıl, uygun olanı buyurup fenalığı önle, başına gelene sabret; doğrusu bunlar, azmedilmeğe değer işlerdir.\""
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "031/017",
            "text": "O my son, establish prayer, enjoin what is right, forbid what is wrong, and be patient over what befalls you. Indeed, [all] that is of the matters [requiring] determination."
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "031/017",
            "text": "Son, establish Prayer, enjoin all that is good and forbid all that is evil, and endure with patience whatever affliction befalls you. Surely these have been emphatically enjoined."
          }
        },
        {
          "ref": "031/018",
          "surah": 31,
          "ayah": 18,
          "arabic": "وَلَا تُصَعِّرْ خَدَّكَ لِلنَّاسِ وَلَا تَمْشِ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ مَرَحًا ۖ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يُحِبُّ كُلَّ مُخْتَالٍ فَخُورٍ",
          "tr": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
            "sourceRef": "031/018",
            "text": "\"İnsanlara yanağını çevirip (büyüklenme) ve böbürlenmiş olarak yeryüzünde yürüme. Çünkü Allah, büyüklük taslayıp böbürleneni sevmez.\""
          },
          "trAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "031/018",
            "text": "\"İnsanları küçümseyip yüz çevirme, yeryüzünde böbürlenerek yürüme; Allah, kendini beğenip övünen hiç kimseyi şüphesiz ki sevmez.\""
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "031/018",
            "text": "And do not turn your cheek [in contempt] toward people and do not walk through the earth exultantly. Indeed, Allah does not like everyone self-deluded and boastful."
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "031/018",
            "text": "Do not (contemptuously) turn your face away from people, nor tread haughtily upon earth. Allah does not love the arrogant and the vainglorious."
          }
        }
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "priority_key": "normal",
        "priority": 1,
        "boost": {
          "enabled": false,
          "weight": 1
        },
        "note": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
        "updated_at": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00"
      },
      "surah_name": "Lokman",
      "ayah_number": 17,
      "ayah_end_number": 18,
      "text_ar": "﴿17﴾ يَـٰبُنَىَّ أَقِمِ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ وَأْمُرْ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ وَٱنْهَ عَنِ ٱلْمُنكَرِ وَٱصْبِرْ عَلَىٰ مَآ أَصَابَكَ ۖ إِنَّ ذَٰلِكَ مِنْ عَزْمِ ٱلْأُمُورِ\n\n﴿18﴾ وَلَا تُصَعِّرْ خَدَّكَ لِلنَّاسِ وَلَا تَمْشِ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ مَرَحًا ۖ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يُحِبُّ كُلَّ مُخْتَالٍ فَخُورٍ",
      "text_tr": "[17] \"Ey oğlum, namazı dosdoğru kıl, ma'rufu emret, münkerden sakındır ve sana isabet eden (musibetler)e karşı sabret. Çünkü bunlar, azmedilmesi gereken işlerdendir.\n\n[18] \"İnsanlara yanağını çevirip (büyüklenme) ve böbürlenmiş olarak yeryüzünde yürüme. Çünkü Allah, büyüklük taslayıp böbürleneni sevmez.\"",
      "text_en": "[17] O my son, establish prayer, enjoin what is right, forbid what is wrong, and be patient over what befalls you. Indeed, [all] that is of the matters [requiring] determination.\n\n[18] And do not turn your cheek [in contempt] toward people and do not walk through the earth exultantly. Indeed, Allah does not like everyone self-deluded and boastful.",
      "priority": 1,
      "notes": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
      "approvedAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
