        "input_char_count": 135,
        "input_status": "ok",
        "input_source_ref_groups": "033/015"
      },
      "source": {
        "arabic": "Tanzil Quran Text / Uthmani text",
        "tr": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
        "trAlt": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
        "en": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
        "enAlt": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi"
      },
      "sourceRefGroups": [
        "033/015"
      ],
      "ayahs": [
        {
          "ref": "033/015",
          "surah": 33,
          "ayah": 15,
          "arabic": "وَلَقَدْ كَانُوا۟ عَـٰهَدُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ مِن قَبْلُ لَا يُوَلُّونَ ٱلْأَدْبَـٰرَ ۚ وَكَانَ عَهْدُ ٱللَّهِ مَسْـُٔولًا",
          "tr": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
            "sourceRef": "033/015",
            "text": "Oysa andolsun, daha önce 'arkalarını dönüp kaçmayacaklarına' dair Allah'a söz vermişlerdi; Allah'a verilen söz (ahid) ise, (ağır bir) sorumluluktur."
          },
          "trAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "033/015",
            "text": "And olsun ki, daha önce, sırt çevirip kaçmayacaklarına dair Allah'a ahd vermişlerdi. Allah'a verilen ahd sorulacaktır."
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "033/015",
            "text": "And they had already promised Allah before not to turn their backs and flee. And ever is the promise to Allah [that about which one will be] questioned."
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "033/015",
            "text": "They had earlier covenanted with Allah that they would not turn their backs in flight. And a covenant made with Allah must needs be answered for."
          }
        }
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "priority_key": "normal",
        "priority": 1,
        "boost": {
          "enabled": false,
          "weight": 1
        },
        "note": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
        "updated_at": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00"
      },
