    {
      "ref": "042/024",
      "id": "042/024",
      "surah": 42,
      "ayahStart": 24,
      "ayahEnd": 24,
      "type": "single",
      "ayahCount": 1,
      "input": {
        "sira": 1112,
        "ref": "042/024",
        "input_type": "tekil",
        "input_ayah_count": 1,
        "input_char_count": 222,
        "input_status": "ok",
        "input_source_ref_groups": "042/024"
      },
      "source": {
        "arabic": "Tanzil Quran Text / Uthmani text",
        "tr": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
        "trAlt": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
        "en": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
        "enAlt": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi"
      },
      "sourceRefGroups": [
        "042/024"
      ],
      "ayahs": [
        {
          "ref": "042/024",
          "surah": 42,
          "ayah": 24,
          "arabic": "أَمْ يَقُولُونَ ٱفْتَرَىٰ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ كَذِبًا ۖ فَإِن يَشَإِ ٱللَّهُ يَخْتِمْ عَلَىٰ قَلْبِكَ ۗ وَيَمْحُ ٱللَّهُ ٱلْبَـٰطِلَ وَيُحِقُّ ٱلْحَقَّ بِكَلِمَـٰتِهِۦٓ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ عَلِيمٌۢ بِذَاتِ ٱلصُّدُورِ",
          "tr": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
            "sourceRef": "042/024",
            "text": "Yoksa onlar: \"Allah'a karşı yalan düzüp-uydurdu\"mu diyorlar? Oysa eğer Allah dilerse senin de kalbini mühürler. Allah, batılı yok edip-ortadan kaldırır ve Kendi kelimeleriyle hakkı hak olarak pekiştirir (gerçekleştirir). Çünkü O, sinelerin özünde olanı bilendir."
          },
          "trAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "042/024",
            "text": "Yoksa senin için \"Allah'a karşı yalan yere iftira etti\" mi derler? Allah dilerse senin kalbini mühürler, batılı da yok eder, hakkı sözleriyle gerçekleştirir. Doğrusu O, kalplerde olanı bilendir."
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "042/024",
            "text": "Or do they say, \"He has invented about Allah a lie\"? But if Allah willed, He could seal over your heart. And Allah eliminates falsehood and establishes the truth by His words. Indeed, He is Knowing of that within the breasts."
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "042/024",
            "text": "Do they say: “He has forged a lie against Allah?” If Allah so wanted He could seal up your heart. Allah blots out falsehood and confirms the truth by His Words. He is well aware of all the secrets hidden in the breasts (of people)."
          }
        }
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "priority_key": "normal",
        "priority": 1,
        "boost": {
          "enabled": false,
          "weight": 1
        },
        "note": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
        "updated_at": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00"
      },
