      "surah_name": "Zuhruf",
      "ayah_number": 15,
      "ayah_end_number": 15,
      "text_ar": "وَجَعَلُوا۟ لَهُۥ مِنْ عِبَادِهِۦ جُزْءًا ۚ إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ لَكَفُورٌ مُّبِينٌ",
      "text_tr": "(Buna rağmen) Kendi kullarından O'na bir parça kılıp-yakıştırdılar. Doğrusu insan, açıkça bir nankördür.",
      "text_en": "But they have attributed to Him from His servants a portion. Indeed, man is clearly ungrateful.",
      "priority": 1,
      "notes": "bulk approved from local Tanzil source",
      "createdAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-09T08:52:44+00:00",
