        "trAlt": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
        "en": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
        "enAlt": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi"
      },
      "sourceRefGroups": [
        "053/026"
      ],
      "ayahs": [
        {
          "ref": "053/026",
          "surah": 53,
          "ayah": 26,
          "arabic": "وَكَم مِّن مَّلَكٍ فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ لَا تُغْنِى شَفَـٰعَتُهُمْ شَيْـًٔا إِلَّا مِنۢ بَعْدِ أَن يَأْذَنَ ٱللَّهُ لِمَن يَشَآءُ وَيَرْضَىٰٓ",
          "tr": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.bulac / Ali Bulaç",
            "sourceRef": "053/026",
            "text": "Göklerde nice melekler vardır ki, onların şefaatleri hiçbir şeyle yarar sağlamaz; ancak Allah'ın dileyip razı olduğu kimseye izin verdikten sonra başka."
          },
          "trAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "053/026",
            "text": "Allah, dilediğine ve hoşnut olduğuna izin vermedikçe, göklerde bulunan nice meleklerin şefaati bir şeye yaramaz."
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "053/026",
            "text": "And how many angels there are in the heavens whose intercession will not avail at all except [only] after Allah has permitted [it] to whom He wills and approves."
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "053/026",
            "text": "Numerous are the angels in the heavens; yet their intercession shall be of no avail, except in regard to those whom He grants the leave of intercession and whose plea He is pleased to accept."
          }
        }
      ],
      "status": "approved",
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "priority_key": "normal",
        "priority": 1,
