      "surah_name": "Hakka",
      "ayah_number": 4,
      "ayah_end_number": 6,
      "text_ar": "﴿4﴾ كَذَّبَتْ ثَمُودُ وَعَادٌۢ بِٱلْقَارِعَةِ\n\n﴿5﴾ فَأَمَّا ثَمُودُ فَأُهْلِكُوا۟ بِٱلطَّاغِيَةِ\n\n﴿6﴾ وَأَمَّا عَادٌ فَأُهْلِكُوا۟ بِرِيحٍ صَرْصَرٍ عَاتِيَةٍ",
      "text_tr": "[4] Semud ve Ad (toplumları), karia’yı yalan saydılar.\n\n[5] Bu nedenle Semud (halkı), korkunç bir sesle helak edildi.\n\n[6] Ad (halkın)a gelince; onlar da, uğultu yüklü, azgın bir kasırga ile helak edildiler.",
      "text_en": "[4] Thamud and 'Aad denied the Striking Calamity.\n\n[5] So as for Thamud, they were destroyed by the overpowering [blast].\n\n[6] And as for 'Aad, they were destroyed by a screaming, violent wind",
      "priority": 1,
