            "sourceRef": "079/017",
            "text": "\"Firavun'a git; doğrusu o azmıştır.\""
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "079/017",
            "text": "\"Go to Pharaoh. Indeed, he has transgressed."
          },
