            "source": "Tanzil tr.diyanet / Diyanet İşleri",
            "sourceRef": "081/025",
            "text": "Bu Kuran, kovulmuş şeytanın sözü olamaz."
          },
          "en": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.sahih / Saheeh International",
            "sourceRef": "081/025",
            "text": "And the Qur'an is not the word of a devil, expelled [from the heavens]."
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "081/025",
            "text": "nor is it a word of an accursed Satan."
          }
        }
      ],
