            "sourceRef": "092/017",
            "text": "But the righteous one will avoid it -"
          },
          "enAlt": {
            "source": "Tanzil en.maududi / Abul A‘la Maududi",
            "sourceRef": "092/017",
            "text": "But the God-fearing shall be kept away from it,"
          }
        }
      ],
